<p begin="00:00:11.500" end="00:00:13.000">Overlapping line</p>
<p begin="20s" dur="2250ms">I think they will kiss now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.000" end="00:00:32.000">Oh, crap. Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:41.000">&lt;Hello&gt; &amp; goodbye</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.000" end="00:00:47.000">[kissing]</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:52.000">♪ Kiss me, kiss me ♪</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.000" end="00:00:57.000">- ¿Qué BESO?</p>
